<h1>About</h1>
<p>The purpose of this app is to give users the ability to get personalized wardrobe selections based on the weather using a
    high-tech, voice recognition interface: Alexa.</p>

<p>While this app provides users with a web app interface for interaction and upload of wardrobe items, their use of Alexa will
    allow them to let the tech work its magic by using logic with the local weather and wardrobe recommendations based on
    the user’s inputted wardrobe items.
</p>